      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "他本名赫尔曼·马吉特，1861年生在新罕布什尔州。",
      "sha256": "cb24ec4015ac413fb192485b7c59f5505806226ee769ecdafb1de2c68d999742",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "聪明、善谈，在密歇根大学学医；据说那时就开始用尸体骗保险。",
      "sha256": "c634d26b60394e66c7b781846be66de4e07b424f088ca42f1a9673ee5bed7fb9",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "一份保险单，一枚红印章，他靠这套把戏骗过钱。",
      "sha256": "30e2c6c5b7c84888c8616014349e5b1e4ff17ac385adf18948faee01f83d83a9",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "后来他改名霍姆斯，搬到芝加哥，准备大干一场。",
      "sha256": "44f4efb893f9fc8116cc7974ad1fc672444a9bae2dfc1d3af68dd86c85f0b223",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "1886年，他来到芝加哥，接手了英格尔伍德街角的一家药店。",
      "sha256": "94bdd7d7d46e17594800628eff8a8e72c3edab082cc73232aff0dc45c3620007",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "又在对面盖起一栋三层大楼，取名“世界博览会旅馆”。",
      "sha256": "8d57fa79f2b13fc3335d5c034005a236a0b6ba77eea6fca8a7acddabaf37dd7a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "传说，楼里有暗道、活板门，还有没有窗户的房间。",
      "sha256": "070d9306d810a76aca3c2ba893e4fb702ba0aeca7afef4186c79bd98a47c2e05",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他不断换工人，一批走了又来，没人知道大楼全貌。",
      "sha256": "a0ab7da677308ecbcde33044b47f7879d5ff4196daa77f653a7f360bc3344508",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "1893年世博会期间，全城挤满外地游客，失踪几个人没人注意。",
      "sha256": "4554100daab96567430d3cf567e23546b16038cbf1c124ca1e43cd993632c6c2",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "传说，独自来游览的年轻女子，进了那栋楼，再没消息。",
      "sha256": "8733b07b8548d098b1de49b073e2ac78755b6cb3b81e79663ac14464cfde47ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
