      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "可他半路改了主意：皮泰泽尔死了，保险金归了他。",
      "sha256": "8edfd0dcb53e6159a5592654908c9dc4e60ccf169df40adcc167e587fa55df1e",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
