      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "1895年，他承认杀了二十七个人，可其中有人还活着。",
      "sha256": "98c6a77688a973061f1ff64532562690c56523b29d57ab06bddfe3a351b042ed",
